{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31346","headline":"送韦觐谪潘州 · 李明远","name":"送韦觐谪潘州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北鸟飞不到，南人谁去游。\n天涯浮瘴水，岭外向潘州。\n草木春秋暮，猨猱日夜愁。\n定知迁客泪，应只对君流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李明远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}